(property "Description" " | design | A0/A1/A2 grounded; Pico I2C0 is separate from Q6A I2C0/I2C2.; Design IO0_0..7 = HOME, BACK, REC, MARK, FN, LOCK, encoder1 press, encoder2 press. IO1 is unconnected and configured output low.; Initialize and read back registers 2-7; poll ports every 20-50ms alongside INT. Perform nine-clock bus recovery after a NACK or timeout." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
