(text "E3 - Керування, Pico HMI, GPIO, GNSS і IMU (2/3)" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6f730b19-8af8-50a0-a1d0-110416ac92e3))
(text "Дроти з'єднують контакти всередині функціональної групи; кожне дерево дротів має одну глобальну мітку з канонічною назвою мережі (рамка-стрілка — мережа виходить за межі групи, пряма рамка — мережа лише цієї групи). Однакові мітки з'єднані на всіх аркушах; земля — символ GND. Рамки OPEN — незакриті ворота з design/E#.json (повний реєстр: OPEN_ITEMS.md); «TBD» у значенні — STACK номіналу не задає, показано стартове значення до стенду." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6556c4c9-e23f-50c6-a2ce-190edc4362e1))
(text "Pico HMI" (at 12.7 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9a7e151b-157d-5efa-96a3-b63d0156e204))
(rectangle (start 12.7 35.56) (end 149.86 50.8) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 960b9874-c24d-5765-a2a0-7c317d11f9bf))
(text "E3-02 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §2.6; §5.2; §8.1 (шлях димінгу)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8e6659f9-f7de-5868-99fe-8686615b38b6))
(text "Brightness control requires confirmed DDC/CI support or an exact Wisecoco KEY/Backlight interface. Pico GP17\nis now reserved for MCP watchdog reset and unavailable for brightness.\nВорота (стенд): Demonstrate ddcutil brightness through the specified RA620 link, or obtain the exact\nKEY/Backlight revision pinout and design a new interface using a free MCP GPIO if suitable. Verify thermal\ndimming; do not reuse Pico GP17." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a34df0fe-cf05-55f5-bfac-fda71e219044))
(rectangle (start 12.7 53.34) (end 149.86 81.28) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid f9713cea-bd7f-5ab3-a3ce-1c4c1e4911c1))
(text "E3-07 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1; §5.2; §8 (Pico ADC)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 54.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b4140d0d-175e-5efd-8fb0-e6a7dde4add8))
(text "Battery ADC shutdown accuracy must be calibrated. Divider/reference initial tolerances can contribute about\n+/-0.28 V near 13.05 V; a nominal ADC code does not establish the 13.05 +/-0.1 V cutoff. The software window\n12.95-13.15 V must stay above the E1-04 hardware AON UV trip window 12.8 +/-0.1 V on every unit.\nВорота (стенд): Calibrate gain/offset against a calibrated voltmeter at two pack-equivalent voltages such as\n12.6 V and 16.4 V; cross-check INA228. Independently verify the physical 13.05 V software cutoff (labd and\nPico fallback both 13050 mV) within +/-0.1 V, including 5 s dwell, at 12.95/13.05/13.15 V across the specified\ntemperature and load states. Per unit, at maximum and minimum load: the measured software cutoff referred to\nE1_N minus the measured E1-04 hardware trip must be >=0.10 V, and during a controlled discharge the graceful\nshutdown (5 s dwell plus Linux shutdown) must complete before the hardware UV trip asserts OFF; otherwise\nre-trim or reject. Store calibrated coefficients with revision/CRC. No commissioning pass until met; the\nhardware AON UV supervisor remains an independent backup." (at 13.97 56.71 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 04871dba-b8c9-5a94-b514-7edd4b46d8ff))
